                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "16 million will lose their healthcare, but the GOP still found the way to increase the deficit by $2.4 trillion.\n\nIt\u2019s time to wake up, these cuts aren't about reducing the debt, they're about handouts for billionaires and sending the bill to working families.",
