                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last Congress, I voted in favor of the SUPPORT Act, a bill to fund programs to prevent and treat substance abuse. But tonight, I voted no. \n\nI can't back this bill in good conscience while Republicans gut Medicaid, defund mental health care, and let the Trump administration dismantle SAMHSA.\n\nAmericans deserve more than empty promises.",
