                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Senate Republicans just voted to starve the poor, strip healthcare from families, and defund education so the rich can get another damn tax break.\n\nThey call it the \u201cBig, Beautiful Bill.\u201d There\u2019s nothing beautiful about greed and cruelty.",
