                "text": "Republicans are pushing the biggest Medicaid cut in US history.  \n\nUp to 1.5 M New Yorkers could lose their insurance. Constituents with serious health conditions have told me point blank they won\u2019t survive without Medicaid.  \n\nJust 4 House Republicans can stop this madness.",
