                "text": "Today, the GOP, including every NY Republican, voted to make America sicker, hungrier, & poorer \u2014 just to give billionaires more tax breaks.\n\u00a0\nI refuse to stay silent while they gut Medicaid, shut down hospitals, & take food off families\u2019 tables. We won\u2019t forget this betrayal. https://t.co/HdqX5xoMjV",
