                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Just weeks after gutting Medicaid, House Republicans passed another $9 billion in cuts. This time, targeting global health, public broadcasting, and aid for kids fleeing war.\n\nAll to please Trump and Elon Musk.\n\nWorking families deserve better. I voted NO! https://t.co/OBK6XvxkMY",
