                "text": "Latina Equal Pay Day reminds us that Latinas earn just 58 cents for every dollar earned by white men.\n\nThis gap is lost wages that could mean rent, childcare, or healthcare.\n\nWe must fight for equal pay, strengthen workplace protections, and ensure every woman is paid what she\u2019s worth.",
