                "text": "Last week, I hosted a healthcare roundtable where Gretchen Jefferson shared her powerful story. \n\nWhen she was unexpectedly diagnosed with cancer, Medicaid ensured she received the care she needed to reach the finish line. \n\nMedicaid saves lives \u2014 Republican cuts to Medicaid would deprive New Yorkers of the lifesaving care they depend on.",
